  "description": "RPAHUB.FileUtilities is a comprehensive set of custom activities designed to simplify advanced file and folder operations in UiPath. This package offers powerful tools for file comparison, file counting, duplicate detection, file cleanup, and bulk file manipulation (e.g., move, delete, search by date or extension). Whether you're building automation for system housekeeping, report management, or large-scale document processing, this package helps you manage files efficiently and reliably — with built-in flexibility and performance in mind.",
